{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to the Legend of the Heroes of Anirea</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Tactical RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We bring the pace of modern turn-based RPGs to the strategy and board-like depth of classic tactics. Adapt to your enemies and the battlefield in a combat system built around elemental strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/d175ea1b95a828b0378378c728a11d02.poster.avif?t=1761949130\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/d175ea1b95a828b0378378c728a11d02.webm?t=1761949130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero-Based Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and command over 20 unique heroes from Anirea. Each hero comes with a distinctive skill set and a personal story waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/87cd4fb102a5d7ce168ad1abd4995d92.poster.avif?t=1761949130\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/87cd4fb102a5d7ce168ad1abd4995d92.webm?t=1761949130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Progression </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is not the end! Begin your journey anew with different heroes and experience another unique adventure through a procedurally generated campaign. Collect and equip items, make impactful choices, and guide your party through the regions of Anirea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/29e8ed2012b2ccce706cd55216c94069.poster.avif?t=1761949130\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/29e8ed2012b2ccce706cd55216c94069.webm?t=1761949130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handcrafted Pixel Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in our 2.5D world, where characters, enemies, and environments are lovingly designed in a charming pixel art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/378a6bf67711fdc03766354b5192334f.poster.avif?t=1761949130\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/378a6bf67711fdc03766354b5192334f.webm?t=1761949130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783410?t=1761949130","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783410?t=1761949130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/42ca4e8bab38beb2867befaeef40b93978956593/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761949130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/42ca4e8bab38beb2867befaeef40b93978956593/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761949130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to the Legend of the Heroes of Anirea</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Tactical RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We bring the pace of modern turn-based RPGs to the strategy and board-like depth of classic tactics. Adapt to your enemies and the battlefield in a combat system built around elemental strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/d175ea1b95a828b0378378c728a11d02.poster.avif?t=1761949130\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/d175ea1b95a828b0378378c728a11d02.webm?t=1761949130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero-Based Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and command over 20 unique heroes from Anirea. Each hero comes with a distinctive skill set and a personal story waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/87cd4fb102a5d7ce168ad1abd4995d92.poster.avif?t=1761949130\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/87cd4fb102a5d7ce168ad1